This is the open provisioning layer of the Sovereign Stack: the scripts,
charts, conventions, and agent skills that provision and operate a
fully-owned environment. It is designed to be driven directly by the
owner (and the owner's own AI agent) with no dependency on any hosted
control plane.

The facilitated multi-tenant control plane that orchestrates this layer
is a separate commercial work under a different licence.
